 <h1>Hotfixes &amp; changes</h1><p class="lede">Live WoW Forever hotfixes and racial changes, newest first. The talent calculator matches the live game (build 1.60.1.70862, checked Nov 9).</p><ol style="padding-left:20px;display:grid;gap:12px">
       <li><b style="color:var(--gold)">Nov 9</b><p>Live hotfixes checked. Tauren Plainsrunning (Nov 5): stacks can no longer be built in a battleground's preparation phase and are cancelled while you carry a flag. Orc Command (Nov 6): some Warlock pet abilities were gaining too much from it – fixed. Night Elf Shadowmeld (Nov 6): Druids can no longer use Ravage or Pounce out of it. No racial values changed. Coming Tuesday Nov 10 (Blizzard): sturdier Hunter pets and Voidwalkers, Affliction DoTs made worth casting next to Wrack, and Enhancement Shaman moving to Strength and Attack Power.</p></li>
       <li><b style="color:var(--gold)">Nov 5</b><p>Launch game data (build 1.60.1.70790) checked: Undead Touch of the Grave now triggers as often as intended (it fired too rarely before), and talents that trigger from spells no longer have a lower chance at low spell ranks. All talent calculators match the launch data, including the reworked Rogue, Shaman and Warrior trees.</p></li>
