 <h2>Druid builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">6</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-balance-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Moonkin</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Full 41-point Balance to Moonkin Form with Eclipse, Vengeance, Improved Starfire and Moonfury, plus 10 Restoration points.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>41 / 0 / 10</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-cat-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Feral cat</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Cat DPS with Rend and Tear, Predatory Discipline, Shifting Power, Blood Frenzy and Leader of the Pack, Nature's Reach for hit and Heart of the Wild for Strength.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>9 / 32 / 10</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-bear-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Feral bear tank</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Bear tank that can still cat: Lacerate and Primal Bite for threat, Feral Charge interrupt, Thick Hide, and Leader of the Pack/Rend and Tear for cat swaps.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>9 / 37 / 5</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-resto-healer.html"><span class="tag ">Healer</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Restoration healer</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">HoT-focused Restoration to Wild Growth with Bloom, Improved Regrowth, Swiftmend and Nature's Swiftness, plus Balance for Genesis and Nature's Splendor.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>13 / 0 / 38</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-feral-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Feral leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Cat leveling with bear swaps: Furor, Feral Charge, Leader of the Pack, Rend and Tear and Shifting Power, with Genesis/Nature's Reach and Heart of the Wild.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>9 / 37 / 5</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-resto-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Restoration PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">PvP Restoration with Feral dips for escapes and interrupts: Feral Swiftness, Brutal Impact, Furor and Feral Charge, plus Wild Growth and Bloom.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 11 / 40</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">2</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-guardian-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Pure bear (no Balance)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">No-Balance bear build: Furor, Natural Reaction 5, Lacerate, Primal Bite and Feral Charge for threat and avoidance, with Heart of the Wild and Naturalist.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 41 / 10</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/druid-balance-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Balance multi-DoT leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Multi-DoT Balance leveling: Improved Entangling Roots and Overgrowth root up to 3 mobs while Moonfire and Insect Swarm tick, ending in Moonkin Form.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>43 / 0 / 8</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
