 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=hunter">Hunter talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Hunter#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Hunter builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">5</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-bm-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Beast Mastery</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Pet-centred damage: Frenzy, Ferocity and Bestial Wrath on the pet, with Marksmanship picked up to Mortal Shots for your own crits and Trueshot Aura.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 20 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-mm-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Marksmanship Lone Wolf</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Petless deep Marksmanship: Lone Wolf for +20% damage, Sniper Shot, Barrage and Ranged Weapon Specialization, with Deadly Aspects for Auto Shot haste.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>5 / 46 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-sv-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Survival Lone Wolf</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Lone Wolf Survival that weaves Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick and Lacerating Strikes bleeds between shots, scaling off the 15% Agility from Lightning Reflexes.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>5 / 13 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-bm-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Beast Mastery leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Let the pet tank and kill: Improved Revive Pet and Pathfinding early, Summon Hawk and Intimidation mid-way, Bestial Wrath at 40, then Marksmanship crit and Trueshot Aura.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>33 / 18 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-mm-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Marksmanship PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Ranged burst with Sniper Shot and Mortal Shots plus lots of control: Improved Concussive Shot stuns, Scatter Shot, and Survival's Entrapment, Improved Wing Clip, Deterrence and Counterattack.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 31 / 20</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">2</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-melee-sv.html"><span class="tag ">DPS</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Melee Survival with pet</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Keeps the pet and goes properly melee: Predator's Edge, Expose Prey into Mongoose Bite, Lacerating Strikes bleeds and Strider Kick, with Deflection, Deterrence and Counterattack for survivability.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>7 / 11 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/hunter-pet-mm.html"><span class="tag ">DPS</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Marksmanship with pet</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Deep Marksmanship to Sniper Shot but keeps a pet out, taking Beast Mastery's Unleashed Fury, Ferocity and Summon Hawk instead of Lone Wolf.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>20 / 31 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
