 <p class="crumb"><a href="./">Classes</a> › Mage</p><h1><img src="../img/icons/class-mage.webp" alt="">Mage in WoW Forever</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=mage">Mage talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Mage#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Mage builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">6</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-arcane-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Arcane Power</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Deep Arcane to Arcane Power and full Arcane Mind, dipping Fire for Ignite, Pyroblast and Heating Up plus Precision for hit.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 17 / 3</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-fire-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Fire Combustion</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Full Fire to Combustion with Heating Up Pyroblasts, Critical Mass and Fire Power, topped up with Arcane Concentration and Missile Barrage.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>18 / 31 / 2</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-frost-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Frost Fingers of Frost</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Frost to Ice Barrier with Fingers of Frost, Shatter and 5 Winter's Chill feeding Ice Lance and Cone of Cold, plus Arcane Concentration and Arcane Meditation.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>18 / 0 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-frost-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Frost leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Opens with 7 Arcane points for Missile Barrage, then goes deep Frost for Ice Lance, Fingers of Frost, Winter's Chill and Ice Barrier.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>13 / 5 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-arcane-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Arcane leveling (chain-pull)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Rushes Missile Barrage and Arcane Concentration, then fishes for procs with rank-1 Frostbolt to chain-pull with little drinking.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>32 / 16 / 3</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-frost-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Frost PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Frost with Frostbite, Permafrost, Improved Frost Nova and Shatter for root-and-burst, plus Improved Counterspell and Magic Absorption from Arcane.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>17 / 0 / 34</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">1</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/mage-frostfire.html"><span class="tag ">DPS</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Frostfire (Fire/Frost)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">0/29/22 hybrid that casts Frostfire Bolt with Fire's Accelerant, Ignite and Heating Up, and Frost's Ice Shards, Shatter and Fingers of Frost.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 29 / 22</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
