 <p class="crumb"><a href="./">Classes</a> › Paladin</p><h1><img src="../img/icons/class-paladin.webp" alt="">Paladin in WoW Forever</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=paladin">Paladin talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Paladin#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Paladin builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">6</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-ret-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Retribution two-hander</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Vengeance, Champion of the Light and Unsealed Wrath with a two-hander, plus Improved Seals and Holy Conduit from Holy and Divine Intellect and Precision for hit.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>12 / 8 / 31</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-prot-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Protection tank (Seal damage)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Holy Shield, Reckoning, Iron Creed and Shieldsworn by 40, then Divine Strength and Improved Seals from Holy and Deflection from Retribution for damage and parry.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>13 / 31 / 7</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-deep-prot-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Deep Protection tank</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Takes nearly every defensive Protection talent (Toughness 5, Anticipation 5, Divine Intellect 5) and puts the rest into cheaper Judgements.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 43 / 8</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-holy-healer.html"><span class="tag ">Healer</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Holy healer</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Illumination, Holy Shock, Boundless Light, Holy Power and Light's Vigil, with Divine Intellect and Redoubt from Protection and Benediction from Retribution.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>32 / 14 / 5</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-ret-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Retribution leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Benediction, Conviction and Seal of Command first, Repentance at 30 and Unsealed Wrath at 40, then Divine Strength, Improved Seals and Divine Intellect.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>15 / 5 / 31</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-holy-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Holy PvP healer</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">The full healing Holy tree plus Toughness, Redoubt and Divine Intellect for survival; no Retribution.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>32 / 19 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">2</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-shockadin.html"><span class="tag ">DPS</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Shockadin (two-hander + Holy Shock)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">A two-hander Retribution base stopping at Champion of the Light, with Holy down to Holy Shock so you can Shock and Consecrate between swings.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>23 / 0 / 28</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/paladin-shock-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Holy Shock tank (Holy/Protection)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">A shield tank that swaps deep Protection for Holy Shock, Illumination and Improved Seals while keeping Holy Shield, Swift Judgement and Improved Righteous Fury.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>27 / 24 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
