 <p class="crumb"><a href="./">Classes</a> › Priest</p><h1><img src="../img/icons/class-priest.webp" alt="">Priest in WoW Forever</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=priest">Priest talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Priest#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Priest builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">5</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/priest-shadow-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Shadow</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Standard Shadow: hit from Shadow Focus, Improved Mind Blast, Mind Flay, Shadow Weaving, Darkness and Shadowform, with Discipline for Inner Focus and mana talents.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>18 / 0 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/priest-disc-healer.html"><span class="tag ">Healer</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Discipline healer</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Shields and crit heals: Renewed Hope and Divine Aegis turn crits into absorbs, Penance and Power Infusion at the bottom, Holy for crit chance and faster heals.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 20 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/priest-holy-healer.html"><span class="tag ">Healer</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Holy healer</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Raid healing through Spiritual Guidance, Spiritual Healing, Litany of Light and Prayer of Mending, with Discipline for mana (Mental Strength, Meditation, Mental Agility).</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>19 / 32 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/priest-shadow-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Shadow leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Spirit Tap for downtime-free questing, Mind Flay at 20, Vampiric Embrace at 25 and Shadowform at 40, then Discipline for wand damage and mana.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>17 / 0 / 34</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/priest-disc-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Discipline/Shadow PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Discipline to Power Infusion for shields and mana burn, plus Shadow's Blackout stuns, Improved Mind Blast and a shorter Psychic Scream.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>33 / 0 / 18</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">1</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/priest-smite.html"><span class="tag ">DPS</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Smite priest (Holy damage)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Damage with Smite and Holy Fire: Power in Light, Holy Precision, Divine Fury, Searing Light and Spiritual Guidance, with a short Shadow dip for Shadow Word: Pain.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>19 / 25 / 7</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
