 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=rogue">Rogue talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Rogue#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Rogue builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">5</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/rogue-mutilate-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Mutilate</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Dual-dagger Mutilate with Venom, Relentless Strikes and Seal Fate, plus Combat for hit, Puncturing Wounds and cheaper Eviscerate.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 20 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/rogue-combat-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Combat</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Hack and Slash, Flash of Steel and Adrenaline Rush with Aggression and Weapon Expertise; Assassination for Malice and Lethality.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>12 / 35 / 4</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/rogue-sub-dungeon.html"><span class="tag ">Dungeon</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Subtlety Hemorrhage / Death Mark</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Hemorrhage, Boot Knife, Shank and Death Mark with Ambush openers, plus Malice and Improved Slice and Dice.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>11 / 9 / 31</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/rogue-combat-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Combat leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Sinister Strike, Riposte and Blade Flurry by 30 and Adrenaline Rush at 40, with any weapon type, then Malice, Lethality and Cold Blood.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>20 / 31 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/rogue-sub-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Subtlety PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Setup, Initiative, Dirty Deeds/Tricks and Elusiveness for openers and control, with Combat Lightning Reflexes, Improved Kick and Improved Sprint.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>5 / 17 / 29</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">1</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/rogue-sub-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Subtlety Hemorrhage leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Levels as Subtlety instead of the usual Combat: Setup and Opportunity first, Hemorrhage at 30 and Death Mark at 40, then Assassination for crit.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>20 / 0 / 31</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
