 <p class="crumb"><a href="./">Classes</a> › Shaman</p><h1><img src="../img/icons/class-shaman.webp" alt="">Shaman in WoW Forever</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=shaman">Shaman talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Shaman#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Shaman builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">6</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-ele-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Elemental</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Lightning Elemental: Call of Thunder crit, Lightning Overload, Elemental Fury and Lightning Mastery, with Restoration for mana and hit.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>32 / 5 / 14</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-enh-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Enhancement</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Stormstrike, Flurry, Maelstrom Weapon and Rage of the Farseer, with Elemental Devastation and Concussion for crit and lightning damage.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>8 / 33 / 10</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-resto-healer.html"><span class="tag ">Healer</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Restoration healer</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Deep Restoration for Riptide, Purification, Healing Way and Mana Tide Totem, with Thundering Strikes as the only off-tree pick.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 5 / 46</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-ele-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Elemental leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Caster leveling with Elemental Focus, Trial by Fire and Earthbound for kiting, then Lightning Overload, Elemental Fury and Lightning Mastery; Restoration for mana.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>33 / 7 / 11</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-enh-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Enhancement leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Melee leveling with Stormstrike, Improved Stormstrike, Spirit Weapons and early Flurry, plus Elemental crit (Elemental Devastation) and Trial by Fire.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>18 / 25 / 8</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-ele-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Elemental PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Elemental burst to Lightning Mastery with Eye of the Storm and Elemental Warding, plus Enhancement Toughness, Guardian Totems, Earth's Grasp and Improved Ghost Wolf.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 20 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">2</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-elehance.html"><span class="tag ">DPS</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Elehance (Elemental/Enhancement)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Splits points to get both Lightning Overload/Elemental Fury and Stormstrike/Flurry, weaving melee swings between Lightning Bolts.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>29 / 22 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/shaman-enh-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Shaman tank (shield + Rockbiter)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">One-hand + shield dungeon tank using Rockbiter threat, Spirit Weapons parry, Anticipation dodge and Improved Stormstrike resets, with Restoration for hit and mana.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 40 / 11</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
