 <p class="crumb"><a href="./">Classes</a> › Warlock</p><h1><img src="../img/icons/class-warlock.webp" alt="">Warlock in WoW Forever</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=warlock">Warlock talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Warlock#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Warlock builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">9</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-aff-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Affliction Demonic Sacrifice</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Deep Affliction with Wrack as filler, Pandemic, Soul Siphon and Shadow Mastery, plus Demonology for Demonic Sacrifice (Imp: +15% Shadow).</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>35 / 11 / 5</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-aff-ruin-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Affliction Ruin</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Wrack as filler with full Soul Siphon, plus 18 Destruction points for Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane, Ruin and Agonizing Flames.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>33 / 0 / 18</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-demo-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Demonology Demonic Pact</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">31 Demonology to Demonic Pact so you can sacrifice the Imp and keep the Sayaad, with Demonic Brand and Decimation, plus Improved Shadow Bolt/Bane/Ruin.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>2 / 31 / 18</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-destro-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Destruction Fire</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Petless Fire Destruction: sacrifice the Sayaad for +15% Fire, with Incinerate, Shadow and Flame, Fire and Brimstone, Ruin and Aftermath.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>7 / 11 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-destro-sayaad-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Destruction with Sayaad</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">The Sayaad stays out with Unholy Power 4, while Affliction gives hit, Improved Life Tap, Amplify Curse and Pandemic.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>14 / 4 / 33</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-aff-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Affliction leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">No-respec Affliction leveling: instant Corruption and hit first, then Unholy Power for the pet, drain-tanking from 30 and Shadow Mastery late.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>40 / 7 / 4</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-drain-tank-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Drain-tank leveling (Voidwalker)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Drain-tank leveling: the Voidwalker tanks while Wrack, Soul Siphon and Fel Concentration keep drains going, with Demonology for a tougher, cheaper pet.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>33 / 18 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-demo-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Demonology leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Respec at 27 so the Sayaad holds 2-3 mobs with Demonic Brand, building to Demonic Pact at 40, then Affliction for instant Corruption and hit.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>20 / 31 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warlock-destro-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Destruction PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Bursty Fire Destruction for PvP, with Molten Skin damage reduction, Intensity against pushback, Pyroclasm stuns and Demonology for Stamina and Sayaad control.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>0 / 13 / 38</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">0</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><p class="old">None yet.</p></div></div></div>
