 <p class="crumb"><a href="./">Classes</a> › Warrior</p><h1><img src="../img/icons/class-warrior.webp" alt="">Warrior in WoW Forever</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="../calculator.html?c=warrior">Warrior talent calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="../?class=Warrior#picker">Race picker</a></p>
 <h2>Warrior builds</h2><div class="cols2"><div><h3 style="color:#8fc4e8">Meta <span class="pill">5</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">The builds most players run.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warrior-arms-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Arms two-hander</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Two-hander Mortal Strike build with Weaponmaster, Improved Slam and Bloodthrill, dipping Fury for Cruelty, Unbridled Wrath and Booming Voice.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>32 / 17 / 2</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warrior-fury-raid.html"><span class="tag ">Raid</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Fury dual-wield</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Dual-wield Bloodthirst build with Flurry, Improved Whirlwind and full Dual Wield Specialization, taking Arms down to Impale and Anger Management.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>17 / 34 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warrior-prot-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Protection shield tank</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Shield Slam tank with Bastion, Defiance, Focused Rage and Improved Revenge; Arms gives Deflection, Tactical Mastery and Anger Management.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>11 / 5 / 35</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warrior-arms-leveling.html"><span class="tag lv">Leveling</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Arms leveling</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Rend, Overpower and Deep Wounds early, Sweeping Strikes at 30, Mortal Strike at 40, then Fury for crit and rage.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 20 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warrior-arms-pvp.html"><span class="tag ">PvP</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Arms PvP</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">Mortal Strike with Improved Hamstring 3 to stop kiting, plus Fury for Cruelty, Enrage and Piercing Howl.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>31 / 20 / 0</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div><div><h3 style="color:var(--ember)">Off-meta <span class="pill">1</span></h3><p class="old" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Uncommon builds that can work – try something different.</p><div class="stack"><a class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block" href="../builds/warrior-fury-prot-tank.html"><span class="tag ">Tank</span><h3 style="margin:8px 0 4px;font:800 18px var(--f-display);color:var(--gold-soft)">Bloodthirst tank (Fury/Protection)</h3><p style="margin:0;color:#d8cfbf;font-size:15.5px">A shield tank that goes 31 deep into Fury for Bloodthirst, Death Wish and Flurry, keeping only the shield and rage basics from Protection.</p><p class="split" style="margin:8px 0 0">Split <b>3 / 31 / 17</b> · level order →</p></a></div></div></div>
